Resistor color codes
Code  Color   Value
B     Black   0
N     Brown   1
R     Red     2
O     Orange  3
Y     Yellow  4
G     Green   5
E     Blue    6
V     Violet  7
A     Gray    8
W     White   9
Resistance of B B B = 0.000000 ohms
Resistance of W W B = 99.000000 ohms
Resistance of A W N = 890.000000 ohms
Resistance of B N O = 1.000000 kilo-ohms
Resistance of A W R = 8.900000 kilo-ohms
Resistance of W W O = 99.000000 kilo-ohms
Resistance of W W Y = 990.000000 kilo-ohms
Resistance of B N E = 1.000000 mega-ohms
Resistance of W W W = 99000.000000 mega-ohms
